<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">1 Johan</book>
  <para style="h">1 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tangsuek hoiah kaom, a thaih o moe, mik hoiah a hnuk o ih, a khet o moe, ban hoiah a sui o ih, hinghaih Lok to ni aicae mah a thuih o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(to hinghaih loe amtueng boeh moe, a hnuk o boeh, hnukung ah a oh o moe, Ampa hoi nawnto kaom, aicae khaeah kamtueng, dungzan hinghaih to nangcae khaeah amtuengsak boeh;)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kaicae hoi angkomhaih na tawnh o thai hanah ka hnuk o moe, ka thaih o ih hmuen to nangcae khaeah kang thuih o: kaicae angkomhaih loe Sithaw hoi a Capa Jesu Kri hoiah kaom angkomhaih ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangcae anghoehaih koepsak hanah hae ca hae kang tarik o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anih khae hoi ka thaih o moe, nangcae khaeah kang thuih o ih lok loe, Sithaw loe aanghaih ah oh, anih khaeah vinghaih tih ta doeh om ai, tiah kaom lok hae ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aicae mah Anih hoi angkomhaih ka tawnh o boeh, tiah a thuih o moe, vinghaih thungah a caeh o nahaeloe, aicae loe loktang hoiah a hing o ai, lok amlai kami ah ni a oh o vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toe anih loe aanghaih thungah oh baktih toengah, aanghaih thungah a caeh o nahaeloe, maeto hoi maeto angkomhaih to a tawnh o moe, a Capa Jesu Kri ih athii mah aicae zaehaihnawk to ang pasaeh pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aicae mah zaehaih ka tawn o ai, tiah a thuih o nahaeloe, aimah hoi aimah angling kami ah ni a oh o, loktang aicae thungah om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zaehaih a taphong o nahaeloe, aicae zaehaih to tahmen moe, katoeng ai hmuennawk boih ciimcaisak hanah, anih loe oepthok katoeng Sithaw ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aicae mah ka zae o ai, tiah a thuih o nahaeloe, aicae thungah a lok to om ai pongah, anih to lok amlai kami ah a suek o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Palung ih ka caanawk, na zae o han ai ah hae ca hae kang tarik o. Toe zaehaih sah kami hanah loe, aicae zuengah lokthuikung, Ampa hoi nawnto kaom, katoeng Jesu Kri to a tawnh o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anih loe aicae zaehaih loisakkung ah oh: aicae han khue ai, long pum ah kaom kaminawk boih ih zaehaih loisakkung ah doeh oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anih ih kaalok to a tahngai o nahaeloe, anih to a panoek o boeh tiah amtueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anih to ka panoek tiah thuih, toe anih ih kaalok to pazui ai nahaeloe, lok amlai kami ah ni oh, to kami thungah loktang to om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toe mi kawbaktih doeh Anih ih lok tahngai kami loe, anih thungah Sithaw amlunghaih to akoep tih: a lok tahngaihaih rang hoiah ni anih khaeah a oh o boeh, tito a panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anih ah ka hing boeh, tiah thui kami loe, anih caehhaih baktiah caeh toeng han angaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, nangcae khaeah kaalok kangtha ka tarik ai, tangsuek natuem hoi na tawnh o ih kaalok kangquem ni ka tarik. Kaalok kangquem loe nangcae mah tangsuek nathuem hoi na thaih o ih lok to boeh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vinghaih loe laemh ving boeh moe, vaihi loe tangtang aanghaih mah toeh boeh pongah, kaalok kangtha nangcae khaeah ka tarik let, to kangtha kaalok loe Anih hoi nangcae khaeah loktang ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aanghaih thungah ni ka oh, tiah a thuih, toe angmah ih amnawk to hnuma kami loe vaihi khoek to vinghaih thungah ni a oh vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Angmah ih amnawk palung kami loe aanghaih thungah oh, to pongah anih loe amthaek han ih loklam om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toe angmah ih amnawk hnuma kami loe, vinghaih thungah oh, vinghaih thungah amkaeh, vinghaih mah mikmaengsak pongah, naa ah maw ka caeh, tito panoek ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nawktanawk, anih ih ahmin hoiah na zae o haihnawk to tahmen boeh pongah, nangcae khaeah ca ka tarik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ampanawk, tangsuek nathuem hoi kaom anih to na panoek o boeh pongah, nangcae khaeah ca ka tarik. Thendoengnawk, kahoih ai kaminawk to na pazawk o boeh pongah, nangcae khaeah ca ka tarik. Nawktanawk, Ampa to na panoek o boeh pongah, nangcae khaeah ca ka tarik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ampanawk, tangsuek nathuem hoi anih to na panoek o boeh pongah, nangcae khaeah ca ka tarik. Thendoengnawk, tha na cak o moe, nangcae thungah Sithaw lok oh pongah, kahoih ai kaminawk to na pazawk o, to pongah nangcae khaeah ca ka tarik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Long hoi a thungah kaom hmuennawk to palung o hmah. Long palung kami loe, anih thungah Ampa palunghaih to om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Long hmuen ah kaom, taksa koehhaih, mik hoi khithaih, a tawnh ih hmuen hoi amoekhaihnawk loe Ampa khae hoiah angzo ai, long hoiah ni tacawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Long hoi long koehhaih loe anghmat boeh: toe Sithaw koehhaih sah kami loe dungzan khoek to cak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nawktanawk, vaihi loe boenghaih atue ah ni oh boeh: Kri lok aek kaminawk angzo o tih, tiah na thaih o baktih toengah, pop parai Kri ih lokaek kaminawk vaihi angzoh o boeh; to pongah vaihi loe boenghaih atue boeh ni, tito a panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nihcae loe aicae khae hoi tacawt o ving boeh, nihcae loe aicae ih kami na ai ni; aicae kami ah om o nahaeloe, aicae hoi nawnto om o poe tih: toe tacawt o ving boeh pongah, nihcae loe aicae ih kami na ai boeh ni, tiah amtueng boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toe nangcae loe Kaciim Kami mah situi ang bawh o pongah, hmuennawk boih na panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Loktang na panoek o ai pongah hae ca hae ka tarik ih na ai ni, loktang to na panoek o, amsawnlok thuihaih loe loktang thung hoiah angzo ai, tiah na panoek o pongah ni ca kang tarik o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lok amlai kami loe mi aa? Jesu loe Kri na ai ni, tiah angaek kami to ni. Ampa hoi Capa talawk ai kami loe Kri ih misa ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Capa lokaek kami loe, Ampa to tawn ai: toe Capa talawk kami loe, Ampa doeh a tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tangsuek nathuem hoiah na thaih o ih lok to nangcae thungah om poe nasoe. Tangsuek nathuem hoi na thaih o ih lok to nangcae thungah om poe nahaeloe, nangcae doeh Capa hoi Ampa ah na om o poe tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anih mah aicae khaeah paek ih lokkamhaih loe, dungzan hinghaih lok hae ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Acoehaih hoi kho na sak o thai hanah nangcae aling han pacaeng kaminawk kawng to hae tiah kang tarik o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toe nangcae situi bawh Anih to nangcae thungah oh pongah, nangcae loe minawk mah patuk han angaih ai: to tiah nangcae situi bawh kami mah hmuennawk boih ang patuk o, Anih loe loktang ah oh moe, lok amlai ai, Anih mah to tiah ang patuk o baktih toengah, Anih khaeah na oh o poe han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nawktanawk, vaihi anih khaeah om o poe ah; to tiah ni anih amtueng naah, aicae mah angoephaih a tawn o ueloe, anih angzoh naah a hmaa ah azathaih tawn ai ah a om o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anih loe katoeng kami ah oh, tiah na panoek o nahaeloe, toenghaih sah kaminawk boih loe anih mah tapen ih caa ah oh o, tiah panoek kami ah na oh o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aicae loe Sithaw caa ah a oh o, tiah kawk thai hanah, Sithaw loe kawbaktih amlunghaih maw aicae nuiah tawnh, tito khen oh: long mah Anih panoek ai pongah, aicae doeh panoek ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Palung ih kaminawk, aicae loe vaihi Sithaw caa ah ni a oh o boeh, hmabang ah kawbaktih kami ah maw a om o tih, tito amtueng ai vop: toe anih amtueng naah aicae loe Anih baktiah a om o tih, tito a panoek o; Anih to angmah baktih toengah a hnu o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anih ah oephaih tawn kami loe, Anih ciimcai baktih toengah, angmah hoi angmah to ciimcai ah khosak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi kawbaktih doeh zaehaih sah kami loe kaalok doeh a aek: zae, tiah thuih ih lok loe kaalok aekhaih hae ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toe anih loe aicae zaehaihnawk lak ving han ih ni amtueng, tito na panoek o; anih ah zaehaih om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi kawbaktih doeh anih ah om kami loe zaehaih sah ai: zaehaih sah kami loe anih to hnu ai, panoek doeh panoek ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Palung ih nawktanawk, mi mah doeh na ling o hmah nasoe: anih loe toeng baktih toengah, katoeng kami mah loe katoeng hmuen to sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zaehaih sah kami loe taqawk ih kami ah ni oh; taqawk loe tangsuek natuem hoi boeh ni zaehaih to a sak. Sithaw Capa loe taqawk toksakhaihnawk to phraek han ih ni angzoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sithaw mah tapen ih kami loe zaehaih sah ai; anih ih atii loe Sithaw ah oh poe: Sithaw mah tapen ih kami ah oh pongah, anih loe zae thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hae tiah Sithaw caa hoi taqawk caa to angmaat thaih: toenghaih sah ai kami, angmah ih amnawk palung ai kami loe Sithaw ih kami na ai ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aicae maeto hoi maeto amlung han oh, tiah thuih ih lok loe, tangsuek nathuem hoi na thaih o hmaloe ih lok ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kasae poekhaih katawn, amnawk kahum, Kain baktiah om o hmah. Tipongah anih mah angmah ih amnawk to hum? tiah thuih nahaeloe, anih mah sak ih hmuen loe toeng ai, amnawk mah sak ih hmuen to toeng pongah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, long mah na hnuma o nahaeloe, dawnrai o hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk to a palung o pongah aicae loe duekhaih thung hoiah a poeng o boeh moe, hinghaih thungah akun o boeh. Amnawk palung ai kami loe duekhaih thungah ni oh vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nawkamya hnuma kami loe kami hum kami ah ni oh: kami hum kami loe dungzan hinghaih tawn ai, tito na panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aicae han a hinghaih paek pongah, aicae mah Sithaw amlunghaih to a panoek o: aicae mah doeh nawkamyanawk hanah aimacae hinghaih paek toeng han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi kawbaktih doeh hae long nuiah kahoih hmuennawk to tawnh mangh, nawkamya vawthaih doeh a hnuk e, anih nuiah tahmenhaih tawn ai nahaeloe, kawbangmaw Sithaw amlunghaih anih thungah om tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nawktanawk, lok hoiah maw, palai hoiah maw amlung o hmah si; loktang hoi toksakhaih hoiah amlung o si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />To tiah amlunghaih rang hoiah aicae loe loktang ih kami ah a oh o, tito amtueng, to pongah aicae loe Anih hmaa ah kamongah om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aimacae ih palung mah aicae zaehaih net cadoeh, Sithaw loe aicae ih palung pongah len kue, anih mah hmuennawk to panoek boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Palung ih kaminawk, aimacae ih palung mah aicae zaehaih net ai nahaeloe, oephaih hoiah Sithaw khaeah a caeh o han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anih mah thuih ih loknawk to a pazui o moe, a koeh ih hmuennawk to a sak o pongah, anih khae hoiah a hnik o ih hmuennawk to a hnuk o boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aicae han kaalok ang paek baktih toengah, aicae mah a Capa Jesu Kri ih ahmin to tang moe, maeto hoi maeto amlung han oh, hae loe anih mah paek ih kaalok ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anih mah paek ih kaalok tahngai kami loe Anih thungah oh, Anih doeh to kami thungah oh toeng. Anih mah aicae han paek ih Muithla rang hoiah ni Anih aicae thungah oh, tiah a panoek o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Palung ih kaminawk, muithla boih to tang o hmah, to muithlanawk loe Sithaw ih Muithla maw, tiah tanoek oh: pop parai angsahcop tahmaanawk long nuiah caeh o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu Kri loe taksa ah angcoeng, tiah kathui muithla loe Sithaw ih Muithla ah oh, to tiah Sithaw ih Muithla to na panoek o thaih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu Kri loe taksa ah angzoh, tiah taphong ai muithla loe Sithaw ih Muithla na ai ni: to baktih muithla loe Kri lok aek muithla ni, to muithla to angzo tih, tiah na thaih o boeh; to muithla loe vaihi doeh long nuiah oh boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nawktanawk, nangcae loe Sithaw ih kami ah na oh o, to baktih kaminawk to na pazawk o boeh: tipongah tih nahaeloe nangcae thungah kaom Anih loe long ah kaom anih pongah len kue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nihcae loe long ih kami ah oh o, to pongah long ih hmuen to a thuih o, a thuih o ih lok to long mah tahngaih pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aicae loe Sithaw ih kami ah a oh o: Sithaw panoek kami mah loe aicae ih lok to tahngaih; Sithaw ih kami ah om ai kami mah loe aicae ih lok to tahngai ai. Hae tiah loktang Muithla hoi lok amlai muithla to a panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kang palung o ih kaminawk, maeto hoi maeto amlung o si: amlunghaih loe Sithaw ih ni; amlunghaih tawn kami loe Sithaw mah tapen ih kami ah oh moe, Sithaw to panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amlunghaih tawn ai kami loe Sithaw panoek ai; Sithaw loe amlunghaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih rang hoiah a hing o thai hanah, Sithaw mah a tawn ih maeto khue a Capa to long ah patoeh boeh, hae tiah Sithaw amlunghaih to aicae khaeah amtueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amlunghaih loe, Aicae mah Sithaw palung ih na ai ah, aicae ang palung pongah, aicae zaehaih tahmen hanah a Capa long ah patoehhaih to ni amlunghaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Palung ih kaminawk, Sithaw mah aicae palung phi pongah, aicae doeh maeto hoi maeto amlung han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi mah doeh Sithaw to hnu vai ai. Toe aicae maeto hoi maeto amlung nahaeloe, Sithaw aicae thungah oh moe, aicae thungah anih amlunghaih to akoep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anih mah angmah ih Muithla to aicae khaeah paek boeh pongah, aicae loe Anih ah a oh o moe, Anih doeh aicae ah oh toeng, tito a panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Long pahlongkung ah oh hanah, Ampa mah a Capa to patoeh boeh, tito a hnuk o moe, a taphong o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu loe Sithaw Capa ni, tiah taphong kami loe, anih thungah Sithaw oh, anih doeh Sithaw thungah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sithaw mah aicae palunghaih to a panoek o moe, a tang o boeh. Sithaw loe amlunghaih ah oh; amlunghaih thungah kaom kami loe, Sithaw thungah oh moe, anih thungah Sithaw oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lokcaekhaih niah zithaih a tawnh o han ai ah, aicae loe amlunghaih hoi kakoep ah kho a sak o, hae long nuiah Anih baktiah kho a sak o pongah ni zithaih tawn ai ah a oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amlunghaih ah zithaih om ai; raihaih tong moeng tih, tiah poekhaih tawnh pongah ni zithaih to oh, kakoep amlunghaih mah loe zithaih to anghmatsak: zithaih tawn kami loe kakoep amlunghaih to tawn ai vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih mah aicae palung hmaloe pongah, aicae mah doeh Anih to palung o toeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sithaw ka palung, tiah thuih moe, amnawk hnuma kami loe, lok amlai kami ah oh: a hnuk ih angmah ih amnawk mataeng doeh palung ai kami mah, a hnuk vai ai ih Sithaw to kawbangmaw palung thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anih khae hoiah hae kaalok hae a hnuk o. Sithaw palung kami loe angmah ih amnawk doeh palung.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu loe Kri ni, tiah tang kami loe, Sithaw mah tapen ih kami ah oh: Anih palung kami loe Anih mah sak ih a capa doeh palung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aicae mah Sithaw palung naah, a paek ih lok to tahngaih o: hae tiah sakhaih rang hoiah ni Sithaw ih caanawk a palung o, tito amtueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anih mah paek ih lok tahgaihaih loe, Sithaw amlunghaih ah oh: a paek ih loknawk loe hmuen kazit ah om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sithaw mah tapen ih kami mah loe long to pazawk: aicae tanghaih mah long to pazawk boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu loe Sithaw Capa ni, tiah tang kami khue mah na ai maw long to pazawk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu loe tui hoi athii hoiah ni angzoh; tui hoi khue ai, tui hoi athii hoiah ni angzoh. Muithla loe loktang ah oh pongah, Muithla loe hnukung ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Van ah hnukkung thumto oh; to hnukungnawk loe Ampa, Lok hoi Kacai Muithla cae hae ni: hae thumto loe maeto ah oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Long ah hnukung thumto oh; to hnukungnawk loe muithla, tui hoi athii cae hae ni: hae thumtonawk loe maeto ah oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnukung ah kaom kami mah taphong ih lok mataeng doeh a tang o nahaeloe, Sithaw mah a Capa kawng to taphong boeh pongah, kalen kue hnukung ah kaom Sithaw mah taphong ih lok to a tang o aep han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sithaw Capa tang kami loe hae tiah taphong ih lok loe tangtang ni, tiah panoekhaih palung to a tawnh: Sithaw tang ai kami loe, Sithaw mah a Capa to paek, tiah thuih ih lok to tang ai pongah, Anih to lok amlai kami ah a ohsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sithaw mah aicae hanah dungzan hinghaih to paek boeh, to hinghaih loe a Capa ah oh, tiah taphong ih hae lok loe Sithaw ih lok ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Capa tawn kami loe hinghaih to tawnh; Sithaw Capa tawn ai kami loe hinghaih to tawn ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dungzan hinghaih ka tawnh, tiah na panoek o moe, Sithaw Capa ih ahmin na tang o thai hanah, Sithaw Capa ih ahmin tang nangcae khaeah hae hmuennawk kawng hae kang tarik o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a koehhaih baktiah kawbaktih hmuen doeh a hnik o nahaeloe, anih mah na tahngai pae tih, hae loe aicae mah Sithaw ah a tawnh o ih oephaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lawkthuihaih tahngaih pae, tiah a panoek o nahaeloe, anih khaeah a hnik o ih hmuennawk boih loe hnuk boeh, tiah poek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi kawbaktih doeh angmah ih amnawk mah duek han khoek to kaom ai sak ih zaehaih to hnu nahaeloe, duek han khoek to zaehaih kasah ai kaminawk khaeah Sithaw mah hinghaih paek thai hanah, anih mah lawkthuih pae han oh. Kadueh sakthaih zaehaih to oh: to baktih zaehaih thung hoi loih thai hanah lawkthui pae oh, tiah ka thui ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Katoeng ai hmuennawk boih loe zaehaih ah oh: duek han khoek to kaom ai zaehaih doeh oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi kawbaktih doeh Sithaw mah tapen ih kami loe zaehaih sah ai; Sithaw mah tapen ih kami loe angmah hoi angmah kahoih ah ang khetzawn pongah, kahoih ai kaminawk mah raihaih paek o thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aicae loe Sithaw caa ah a oh o, toe long pum loe kahoih ai taqawk ih ban thungah ni oh, tito a panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sithaw Capa loe loktang Anih to a panoek o thai hanah angzoh. Aicae loe a capa Jesu Kri ah a oh o pongah, loktang Anih ah om kami ah ni a oh o. Anih loe dungzan hinghaih ah oh moe, loktang Sithaw ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Palung ih nawktanawk, krang bokhaih to ayae oh. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
